{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, move to it, take; if heavy, call for help. Check properties and do task. Finally, scan or avoid obstacle. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsPathBlocked    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = CallForHelp    /> <Action ID = ScanEnvironment    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
